Context: Procurements without Calling Tenders

## Procurements without Calling Tenders  
- Withdrawals against Rate Contracts (RC);
- Direct Procurement without Quotation;
- Direct Procurement by Purchase Committee;
- Purchases through Central Purchase organization (DGS&amp;D) or
- (d) other such agencies.  
Rate Contract is essentially a price agreement with the vendors for supply at a specified price and terms and conditions during the period covered by the RC. - Para. 4.8, Manual for Procurement of Goods.
